> > > >>> >
> > > >>> > Does this mean one could pass values=2:n so that the AR term does not exist for an individual's first observation? I am having the same issue where an individual's 1st observation is overfitting heavily. There is a large degradation in performance from my training set to my test set
> > > >>> >
> > > >>> > I assume this is because for an individual's 1st observation there is no lag, so this essentially becomes a free parameter to use to overfit.
