Subject: What is the math behind INLA's AR model?
Message-ID: <YU2x-4atEpY.EIwjuQVLAwAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/YU2x-4atEpY/m/EIwjuQVLAwAJ>
